# Results land here. Only a real model run is tracked.
#
# run_eval.py writes two files per run, named from the provider and a UTC
# timestamp:
#
#     eval-<provider>-%Y%m%dT%H%M%SZ.json
#     eval-<provider>-%Y%m%dT%H%M%SZ.md
#
# where <provider> is exactly "openai" or "fake". The negations below spell out
# that timestamp shape, so they match a results file and nothing else.
#
# A fake provider run stays untracked on purpose. It measures the harness, not a
# model, and a file in the repository that reads like a score nobody can trace
# to a model is worse than no file.
#
# Only this directory is covered. A run pointed somewhere else with --out-dir is
# not governed by this file.
*
!.gitignore
!eval-openai-????????T??????Z.json
!eval-openai-????????T??????Z.md
